  "notes": [
    "x5chain carries leaf and intermediates; the root is the trust anchor and is not carried, though its algorithm signs the intermediate",
    "whole_manifest adds an RFC 3161 timestamp from a classical or a post-quantum TSA; a classical TSA leaves the time evidence forgeable",
